From: Codex
Subject: [PATCH] net: sched: observe committed block and action lifetime

Expose mutation completion separately from counted execution callbacks.
Replay only a real bound callback and carry actual action/old-rule identity.
Identity-only removal does not depend on successful action translation.
Include the approved complete matchall class result in typed offers.

Signed-off-by: Codex
